   'Incredible Ecclesia, the Virtuous': {role: 'extender', does: 'During either Main Phase (Quick Effect): Tribute it to Special Summon Fallen of Albaz from the hand or Deck. It Special Summons itself from the hand only if they control more monsters. Comes from the Deck with Fallen of the White Dragon; returns from the GY to the hand in the End Phase if a Fusion went to the GY. Turns on the revive mode of The Fallen & The Virtuous.', links: {summon: ['Fallen of Albaz']}},
