-  'Springans Kitt': {role: 'extender', does: 'With an Albaz Fusion on the field or in the GY it Special Summons itself; on summon it adds a Branded Spell/Trap from the Deck, GY or face-up banishment, then puts 1 card from the hand on the bottom of the Deck (so it is not a free extra card). Normal Summoned going first for the same search.', links: {search: ['Branded Fusion', 'Branded in High Spirits', 'Branded in Red', 'Branded Opening', 'Branded Retribution']}},
+  // Kitt swap (Claude, 28 Oct; Kevy OK 24 Oct): Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt replaces the DARK Springans Kitt. Written from the
+  // printed text below; DRAFT like the rest of this file, Akiza review pending (with Seto queue item 3, the revive line).
+  'Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt': {role: 'extender', does: 'Special Summons itself from the hand while we control a Tri-Brigade or Springans monster, except Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt (here: Tri-Brigade Mercourier). When it is sent to the GY from anywhere, Deck included (for example as Fusion material), it Special Summons from our GY, in Defense Position, a Tri-Brigade or Springans monster, Fallen of Albaz, or a monster that mentions Fallen of Albaz, except Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt; it does not target (Alexis, 28 Oct). It cannot search Branded Fusion. Each effect once per turn.', links: {summon: ['Fallen of Albaz', 'Tri-Brigade Mercourier']}},
   'Tri-Brigade Mercourier': {role: 'interruption', does: 'While we control an Albaz Fusion: send it from the hand or field to negate a monster effect. If banished (for example as Branded in Red material) it adds an Albaz monster from the Deck.', links: {search: ['Fallen of Albaz']}},
   'Albion the Shrouded Dragon': {role: 'extender', does: 'Named Fallen of Albaz on the field and in the GY. From the hand or GY: send Albaz or a Branded Spell/Trap from the hand to Special Summon it, or from the Deck to put it on the bottom of the Deck (drawing 1 only if it was in the hand). Once per turn.', links: {send: ['Fallen of Albaz', 'Branded in High Spirits', 'Branded Opening', 'Branded Retribution', 'The Fallen & The Virtuous']}},
   'Bystial Magnamhut': {role: 'utility', does: 'Banish a LIGHT or DARK monster from either GY to Special Summon it (a Quick Effect if they control a monster). End Phase: add a Dragon from the Deck or GY. A DARK Dragon for Lubellion and a discard for Branded in High Spirits.'},
