d by sending the above cards from any Monster Zones to the GY. This card can attack monsters a number of times each Battle Phase, up to the number of materials used for it. Once per turn, during the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add 1 \"Polymerization\" Normal Spell or \"Fusion\" Normal Spell from your Deck to your hand."},"6327734":{"role":"WIND \u00b7 Level 3 \u00b7 ATK 0","quick":"Your protection piece. With any Equip Card under your control, your opponent cannot target your Mikanko cards. Becoming equipped searches a Mikanko Trap.","caution":"Her damage reflection and battle survival need an Equip Card on her specifically. Targeting protection is not immunity to all effects."},"6498706":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Reveal 1 Fusion Monster in your Extra Deck and Special Summon, from your hand or Deck, 1 of the Fusion Materials whose name is specifically listed on that card, also you cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck, except Fusion Monsters, the turn you activate this card. You can only activate 1 \"Fusion Deployment\" per turn."},"8264361":{"role":"Conditional \u00b7 Link 2","quick":"No Main Deck monster here is DARK. An opponent\u2019s DARK stolen with Rondo, Talent or sided Ni-Ni can supply it, but you must actually control that monster and avoid the Mikanko restriction. A DARK only in their GY cannot satisfy the summon. A DARK Xyz/Link fallback can also become material later, but that is a detour. A conditional toolbox slot; lower purchase priority.","caution":"Two monsters including DARK. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"8267140":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Pays 1000 LP to banish a Spell/Trap instead of sending it to a useful GY."},"8379983":{"role":"Starter","quick":"Search a different Lunalight monster when summoned, then discard a card. While it stays in the Monster Zone, a Lunalight sent to your GY can be returned to your hand."},"8491308":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Attacks directly and sends a Sky Striker card from Deck to GY after damage."},"9726840":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Sends another controlled card during resolution, deploys an Ace, then locks Extra Deck summons to Aces."},"9839945":{"role":"LIGHT \u00b7 Link 2 \u00b7 ATK 1850","quick":"Uses your own LIGHT Ohime plus another body to access an eligible opposing LIGHT GY monster.","caution":"A strong opposing GY target is conditional. Her availability does not justify abandoning an easier reflection kill."},"10045474":{"role":"Interaction","quick":"Negate a face-up opposing monster. Activate from hand only when you control no cards; when Set, also watch its Spell/Trap column."},"11161666":{"role":"EARTH \u00b7 Level 3 \u00b7 ATK 0","quick":"The bridge to two Level 3 bodies: becoming equipped lets her summon a non-Illusion Mikanko from Deck.","caution":"She has no battle-damage reflection. After Twins sends her, decline her optional GY-equip effect if you need Fire Dance to revive her. Her Deck-summon effect imposes the Mikanko Extra Deck restriction."},"11317977":{"role":"Poly access","quick":"Discard itself as cost to add Polymerization from Deck or a Lunalight monster other than Black Sheep from GY. If sent to GY as Fusion material: recover a face-up Lunalight Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck, or a Lunalight monster other than Black Sheep from your GY."},"11321089":{"role":"3 differently named monsters, at least one from hand and one from field. Requires its stated Fusion Summon and cannot be made with GY-only materials.","quick":"16845"},"11765832":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"2 monsters with the same Type and Attribute, but different names\r\nAny battle damage your opponent takes from battles involving this card is doubled. If this card is sent to the GY: You can draw 1 card. You can only use this effect of \"Garura, Wings of Resonant Life\" once per turn."},"11876803":{"role":"Extender","quick":"Can Special Summon itself from hand after you activate a Lunalight monster effect. If sent to GY by card effect, revives an eligible Lunalight but that monster cannot activate its effects."},"12421694":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Stops an opposing monster from attacking and buys another turn of resources."},"12580477":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Simple full opposing monster clear."},"13935001":{"role":"GY extender","quick":"In your Main Phase, banish it from GY as cost; on resolution, send a card from hand to GY, then summon a Lunalight from Deck if you sent a card. Its face-up trap effect can give the opponent a token after a Fusion Summon."},"14152693":{"role":"Cycle","quick":"On Normal or Special Summon, send a Lunalight card from hand to GY to draw one; its own send-by-effect trigger can revive a small Lunalight with effects negated."},"14532163":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Clears opposing backrow or Attack Position monsters while you control no face-up cards.","caution":"Use it before establishing face-up Mikanko or Equip Spells."},"14558127":{"role":"Hand trap","quick":"Discards itself to negate an effect that adds from Deck, summons from Deck, or sends from Deck."},"15693423":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Best from an empty field at the end of the Battle Phase."},"16259549":{"role":"LIGHT \u00b7 Rank 3 \u00b7 ATK 400","quick":"An unlocked Rank 3 that can survive battle by detaching. Its battle opens the Zeus route.","caution":"It does not reflect battle damage. Have enough LP to survive and a material to prevent destruction; two different players being unable to target it does not make it invulnerable."},"17217034":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Negates a 2500+ ATK monster on summon and can clear monsters after attacking when Raye and Roze are in GY."},"17751597":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated that includes an effect that Special Summons a monster(s): Return to the Extra Deck, 1 face-up Fusion Monster you control, or 2 Fusion Monsters in your GY, that mention \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material, and if you do, negate the activation, and if you do that, destroy that card. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap in your GY, except \"Branded Retribution\"; add it to your hand. You can only use 1 \"Branded Retribution\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."},"18144506":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Simple opposing Spell/Trap clear."},"18144507":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Destroy all Spell and Trap Cards your opponent controls."},"18377261":{"role":"FIRE \u00b7 Level 3 \u00b7 ATK 0","quick":"An equipped Ha-Re searches a Mikanko Equip Spell. A good Arabesque / Fire Dance extender.","caution":"A monster that is merely summoned without becoming equipped does not trigger her search. Double-Edged Sword is not a Mikanko Equip Spell, so Ha-Re cannot search it."},"19096726":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When your opponent activates a monster effect, while you control a Fusion Monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand or face-up field to the GY; negate that effect. If this card is banished: You can add from your Deck to your hand, 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, except \"Tri-Brigade Mercourier\". You can only use each effect of \"Tri-Brigade Mercourier\" once per turn."},"19304410":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If you control a \"Tri-Brigade\" or \"Springans\" monster, except \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\": You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 of the following monsters from your GY in Defense Position, except \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\".\r\n\u25cf \"Tri-Brigade\" monster \u25cf \"Springans\" monster\r\n\u25cf \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 monster that mentions it\r\nYou can only use each effect of \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\" once per turn."},"24010609":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Targets another controlled card at activation, sends it during resolution, then shields later Spell activations from responses. In the End Phase it Sets different Striker Spell names based on activations while face-up."},"24094653":{"role":"Fusion","quick":"Fuse with monsters in hand/field. It is recyclable through Masquerade and Kaleido Chick."},"24224830":{"role":"Protection","quick":"Target one monster in the opponent\u2019s GY, banish it and negate the corresponding effects through the end of the next turn. Limited to one."},"24299458":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Sends cards as cost. Chained Quick-Plays can become efficient payment."},"24550676":{"role":"Panther Dancer + 2 Lunalights; protects itself from opposing targeting and opposing destruction, attacks twice.","quick":"12320"},"24915933":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Blazing Cartesia, the Virtuous\" + 1 LIGHT or DARK monster\r\nIf this card is Fusion Summoned: You can send 1 Level 6 or higher LIGHT or DARK monster from your Deck or Extra Deck to the GY. If a monster is Special Summoned by your opponent's activated monster effect (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card from your field or GY; Special Summon 1 \"Dogmatika\" monster from your Deck or 1 \"Despia\" monster from your Extra Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Granguignol the Dusk Dragon\" once per turn."},"25072579":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Rewrites an opponent's 2000+ ATK monster effect into destroying one of your Ace Links."},"25311006":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Becomes live after an opponent's monster effect in your Main Phase."},"25451383":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"This card's name becomes \"Fallen of Albaz\" while on the field or in the GY. If this card is in your hand or GY: You can send 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your hand or Deck to the GY; apply the following effect based on where you sent it from.\r\n\u25cf Hand: Special Summon this card.\r\n\u25cf Deck: Place this card on the bottom of the Deck, then, if you placed this card from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Albion the Shrouded Dragon\" once per turn."},"26077387":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Quick Effect Tributes herself to deploy a Sky Striker Ace to the Extra Monster Zone."},"29301450":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Generic interaction, but unavailable after Linkage resolves because it is not a Sky Striker Ace."},"29948294":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Reveal 1 monster in your hand and send 1 Level 8 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck to the GY with the same Type that has 2500 ATK or DEF, then you can apply this effect.\r\n\u25cf Discard the revealed monster, and if you do, add 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, from your Deck to your hand.\r\nDuring the End Phase, if a Fusion Monster was sent to your GY this turn: You can add this card from the GY to your hand. You can only use 1 \"Branded in High Spirits\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."},"30271097":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"(This card is always treated as a \"Branded\" and \"Dogmatika\" card.)\r\nActivate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25cf Send 1 monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" from your Extra Deck to the GY, then target 1 face-up card on the field; destroy it.\r\n\u25cf If you have an \"Ecclesia\" monster in your field or GY: Target 1 monster in either GY; Special Summon it to your field.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"The Fallen & The Virtuous\" per turn."},"32807846":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Finds Raye or Roze. Limited to one in this profile."},"33854624":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"You can target 1 LIGHT or DARK monster in either GY; banish it, and if you do, Special Summon this card from your hand. This is a Quick Effect if your opponent controls a monster. If this card is Special Summoned: You can activate this effect; during the End Phase of this turn, add 1 Dragon monster from your Deck or GY to your hand, except \"Bystial Magnamhut\". You can only use each effect of \"Bystial Magnamhut\" once per turn."},"34433770":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Recycles equal numbers of Aces and Striker Spells; every 3 returned cards earns one bounce."},"35261759":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Banishes 10 face-down as cost, then draws 2. Check what is already accessible first."},"35269904":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Turns an opposing monster-effect activation into access to a Normal Spell/Trap.","caution":"Adding needs an opposing monster on field; a card it sets cannot be activated that turn."},"35618217":{"role":"Named material","quick":"Its Deck/Extra Deck send is before the semicolon: a cost. This turn Chick can use that card\u2019s name as Fusion material while face-up on the field."},"35726888":{"role":"Spell/Trap GY setup","quick":"Send a Spell/Trap from Deck to GY. Serenade Dance and Luna Light Perfume are your main targets. One activation per turn."},"35763582":{"role":"GY extender \u00b7 interruption","quick":"If sent to GY by a card effect, summon a different Lunalight from Deck. While that face-up monster remains, Extra Deck summons must be Lunalight. In GY, banish Hound and a Lunalight Fusion to negate a Spell/Trap activation on the field."},"36637374":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Discard 1 card, then take 1 \"Despia\" monster from your Deck, and either add it to your hand or Special Summon it in Defense Position, also for the rest of this turn after this card resolves, you cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck, except Fusion Monsters. If a Fusion Monster(s) you control would be destroyed by card effect, you can banish this card from your GY instead. You can only use each effect of \"Branded Opening\" once per turn."},"37351133":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Can Special Summon herself from hand when another Ace is Summoned. From the GY, an opposing EMZ monster leaving by battle or your effect can relaunch Roze and optionally negate a face-up monster; each effect is once per turn."},"37818794":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Dark Magician\" + \"Red-Eyes Black Dragon\" or 1 Dragon Effect Monster\r\nCannot be destroyed by card effects. Neither player can target this card with card effects. During your Main Phase: You can destroy 1 monster your opponent controls, and if you do, inflict damage to your opponent equal to that monster's original ATK. You can use this effect a number of times per turn up to the number of Normal Monsters used as Fusion Material for this card. Once per turn, when a card or effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can discard 1 card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card, and if you do that, this card gains 1000 ATK."},"38342335":{"role":"Conditional \u00b7 Link 3","quick":"Phoenix (counting as 2) + a leftover Hu-Li (1) works on an unlocked turn. The shuffle also needs a discard. Three ordinary Level 3 Mikanko can meet the rating, but Sanaki\u2019s usual extension has already locked you. A conditional toolbox slot when spare bodies and a discard are available.","caution":"At least two differently named monsters totaling Link Rating 3. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"38811586":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 LIGHT Spellcaster monster\r\nCannot be used as Fusion Material. Your opponent cannot target this card with card effects. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Albion the Sanctifire Dragon\" once per turn. During your opponent's turn (Quick Effect): You can target 2 monsters in any GY(s); Special Summon both monsters, 1 to each field. If this card is in your GY: You can Tribute 4 monsters, the 2 in the Extra Monster Zones and the 2 in the center Main Monster Zones, and if you do, Special Summon this card."},"41373230":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 monster with 2500 or more ATK\r\nGains ATK equal to the combined original Levels of the monsters used for its Fusion Summon x 100. After this card is Fusion Summoned, for the rest of this turn, it is unaffected by the activated effects of any other monsters Special Summoned from the Extra Deck. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add to your hand, or Special Summon, 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or \"Dogmatika\" monster from your Deck. You can only use this effect of \"Titaniklad the Ash Dragon\" once per turn."},"41420027":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Pays half your LP to deny a summon or Spell/Trap activation."},"41927278":{"role":"Equip Spell","quick":"Adds 2000 ATK and assigns battle damage to BOTH players. Against active Uzuhime, your damage share goes to the opponent too: you take 0.","caution":"It is not a Mikanko card. Equip it to the target, not automatically to your attacker. Against a 0 ATK active reflector, a 3300 Kaiju becomes a 10600-damage attack."},"42141493":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Use from an empty field against Deck and Extra Deck summoning strategies."},"42705243":{"role":"Trap","quick":"A set Promise summons a Mikanko from hand/Deck and may equip it from your hand/GY.","caution":"A trap normally cannot activate on the turn it was set. The summoned monster is banished when it leaves the field."},"43527730":{"role":"Equip Spell","quick":"Summons a differently named Mikanko, transfers itself onto it and returns the former equipped monster to hand. Useful for recycling a Kaiju.","caution":"The summon/bounce effect is once per turn. If you bounce the only opposing monster, you may have no monster left to tribute to place the Kaiju again."},"44146295":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster\r\nYou can only control 1 \"Mirrorjade the Iceblade Dragon\". Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck to the GY that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material; banish 1 monster on the field, also this card cannot use this effect next turn. If this Fusion Summoned card in its owner's control leaves the field because of an opponent's card: You can destroy all monsters your opponent controls during the End Phase of this turn."},"44362883":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material from your Extra Deck, using 2 monsters from your hand, Deck, or field as material. You cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, except Fusion Monsters, the turn you activate this card. You can only activate 1 \"Branded Fusion\" per turn."},"44649322":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Special Summons a Mikanko from hand ignoring its conditions. The GY effect supplies another Mikanko card to the GY.","caution":"It does not properly Ritual Summon Ohime. Its summoned monster returns to hand during the opponent\u2019s End Phase."},"44886582":{"role":"Two-material Fusion","quick":"Pay 2000 LP and target an Effect Monster; neither player can respond to this activation. Summon an Extra Deck monster with the same Type AND the same Attribute but a different Level, with effects negated. Then fuse using exactly that monster and the target, or send the summoned monster to GY."},"45883110":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"(This card is always treated as a \"Dogmatika\" and \"Despia\" card.)\r\nIf this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 card that mentions it from your Deck to the GY. If a card(s) leaves the Extra Deck (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, in your GY, except \"Guiding Quem, the Virtuous\"; Special Summon it. You can only use each effect of \"Guiding Quem, the Virtuous\" once per turn."},"46986414":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"''The ultimate wizard in terms of attack and defense.''"},"47705572":{"role":"GY Fusion","quick":"Pendulum effect Fusion Summons a Lunalight using materials banished from field or GY; its scale restricts Pendulum Summons to Lunalights."},"48130397":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Discard 1 card; Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from either field as Fusion Material. Neither player can activate cards or effects in response to this card's activation."},"48444114":{"role":"Revival \u00b7 search","quick":"Revive a Lunalight from GY. Its GY effect banishes Perfume and discards a card as activation costs, then searches a Lunalight monster. A monster discarded for this cost does not trigger an effect requiring a send by card effect."},"48770333":{"role":"Monster","quick":"Third Kaiju; another 3300 ATK damage target.","caution":"Check the current card text and turn restrictions before committing."},"50005218":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Targets another card, excavates 3, and can find a Striker card. Its target need not remain for the excavation."},"50546208":{"role":"Bounce \u00b7 search","quick":"Target another Lunalight card you control, return it to hand to Special Summon Marten from hand/GY in Defense Position; banish Marten when it leaves the field. If sent to GY by card effect, search a Lunalight Spell/Trap."},"51227866":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, targets an opposing GY monster to banish it\u2014or at 3 Spells, Special Summon it instead. The borrowed monster cannot attack and occupies your runway."},"51409648":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 Beast, Beast-Warrior, or Winged Beast monster\r\nWhen a Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster's effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect, then you can return 1 monster from the field to the hand. During your opponent's turn, while this card is in your GY (Quick Effect): You can target 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" in your GY; Special Summon either that monster or this card, and banish the other. You can only use each effect of \"Rindbrumm the Striking Dragon\" once per turn."},"51777272":{"role":"2 Lunalights; a Super Duper stepping stone toward Panther Dancer.","quick":"12318"},"52340444":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, creates a DARK Ace Token in Defense Position that cannot be Tributed. If 3 Spells are in the GY when Hornet resolves, the Token becomes 1500/1500. The card has no printed once-per-turn clause."},"53174748":{"role":"Trap","quick":"Equip a targeted face-up opposing monster to your Mikanko as an Equip Spell.","caution":"It is targeting interaction; check the opponent\u2019s protection. Do not count its equipped monster as a monster-zone Link or Xyz material."},"54701958":{"role":"Leo Dancer + 3 Lunalights; must be Fusion Summoned with those materials. Unaffected except by Lunalight cards; sends a Lunalight from Extra Deck to GY as cost for its board wipe.","quick":"21441"},"54862960":{"role":"Monster","quick":"An equipped Ni-Ni can take a face-up opposing monster during their turn until the End Phase.","caution":"She must be equipped and it must be the opponent\u2019s turn. Targeting protection can prevent the steal."},"55273560":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If your opponent controls more monsters than you do, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon \"Incredible Ecclesia, the Virtuous\" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Incredible Ecclesia, the Virtuous\" once per turn. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 \"Swordsoul\" monster or 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" from your hand or Deck. During the End Phase, if a Fusion Monster(s) was sent to your GY this turn: Add this card from the GY to your hand."},"57103969":{"role":"Starter access","quick":"On activation, search a Level 4 or lower Beast-Warrior, usually Gold Leo. Scarlet Tiger is Level 5 and cannot be searched this way."},"57566760":{"role":"LIGHT \u00b7 Rank 3 \u00b7 ATK 0","quick":"Your main Xyz attacker. Needs two Level 3 Mikanko. Finds Sword, survives battle and makes the opponent take battle damage you would have taken. No Equip Card is needed for her reflection.","caution":"Two Level 3 Mikanko are required. After a completed attack, including a direct attack, detach 1 at the end of the Damage Step to attack again in a row. Two materials can supply up to three attacks; the Equip search alone is once per turn."},"57736667":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Protects its equipped monster from effect destruction, offers a post-battle bounce and GY revival of an eligible Mikanko.","caution":"Reviving an improperly summoned Ritual is still prohibited. A revived monster is banished when it leaves the field."},"60242223":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"You can target 1 LIGHT or DARK monster in either GY; banish it, and if you do, Special Summon this card from your hand. This is a Quick Effect if your opponent controls a monster. If this card is sent to the GY: You can send 1 \"Bystial\" monster or 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your Deck to the GY, except \"Bystial Saronir\". You can only use each effect of \"Bystial Saronir\" once per turn."},"60303245":{"role":"FIRE \u00b7 Link 1 \u00b7 ATK 0","quick":"Converts a Normal Summoned 0 ATK Mikanko into a Link body.","caution":"A Special Summoned Hu-Li does not meet its material text. You cannot Normal Summon her on a Lava Golem turn."},"62962630":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand. If a face-up Fusion Monster you control is destroyed by battle, or leaves the field because of an opponent's card effect, while this card is in your GY: You can target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; Special Summon this card, and if you do, negate the targeted monster's effects until the end of this turn. You can only use 1 \"Aluber the Jester of Despia\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."},"63013339":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Requires 2 Effect Monsters and must first be Link Summoned\u2014Raye and Linkage cannot deploy her directly from the Extra Deck. At 3 or fewer Spells, she loads a Sky Striker card from Deck to GY."},"63166095":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, adds any Sky Striker card except another Engage; if 3 Spells are already in the GY when it resolves, it may also draw 1."},"63288573":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"On Special Summon, targets and returns a Sky Striker Spell from the GY."},"63941210":{"role":"LIGHT \u00b7 Level 10 \u00b7 ATK 3300","quick":"Tribute one eligible opposing monster; leave 3300 ATK on their field. You may also summon another Kaiju to your own field if they control one.","caution":"Each player can control only one Kaiju. To give them a second, first remove the first. It is not a once-per-turn tribute procedure."},"65741786":{"role":"Conditional \u00b7 Link 2","quick":"Hu-Li + Ha-Re can make her on an unlocked turn. Her opponent-turn Link effect then needs I:P plus another available monster, e.g. a leftover Ohime for S:P. Making I:P with your only two bodies does not supply that extra body. Legal but too resource-hungry for this basic plan.","caution":"Two non-Link monsters; Link Rating 2. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"66011101":{"role":"Rank 4 draw/discard or revival option. Its ATK doubling cannot affect Liger Dancer, which ignores non-Lunalight effects.","quick":"14564"},"68468459":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If this card is Normal or Special Summoned (except during the Damage Step): You can discard 1 card; Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters on either field as Fusion Material, including this card, but you cannot use other monsters you control as Fusion Material. You can only use this effect of \"Fallen of Albaz\" once per turn."},"70368879":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Replaces itself and places a Spell in the GY to accelerate the threshold."},"70534340":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"1 DARK monster + \"Fallen of Albaz\"\r\nIf this card is Fusion Summoned: You can discard 1 card; Fusion Summon 1 Level 8 or lower Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, except \"Lubellion the Searing Dragon\", by shuffling Fusion Materials mentioned on it into the Deck, from your monsters on the field, GY, and/or face-up banished cards. For the rest of this turn, this card cannot attack, also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, except Fusion Monsters. You can only use this effect of \"Lubellion the Searing Dragon\" once per turn."},"72167543":{"role":"DARK \u00b7 Rank 4 \u00b7 ATK 2100","quick":"Overlay a surviving Rank 3 or lower Xyz in Main Phase 2 to build the Zeus stack.","caution":"The alternate route is Main Phase 2 only. Do not summon under the Mikanko restriction."},"73819701":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"(This card is always treated as \"Fallen of Albaz\".)\r\nIf this card is in your hand: You can send 1 monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" from your Extra Deck to the GY; Special Summon this card, also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Level 8 Fusion or Synchro Monsters. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 \"Ecclesia\" monster from your hand, Deck, or GY. You can only use each effect of \"Fallen of the White Dragon\" once per turn."},"74405783":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"1 Level 4 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuners\r\nIf this card is Synchro Summoned: You can add 1 Level 4 or 8 Spellcaster monster whose ATK equals its own DEF from your Deck or GY to your hand. You can target 1 face-up card on the field; negate its effects, then if you have an \"Ecclesia\" monster or \"Fallen of Albaz\" in your GY, you can destroy that card. You can only use each effect of \"The Three Champions of Swordsoul\" once per turn."},"74677422":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"''A ferocious dragon with a deadly attack.''"},"75147529":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Uses two monsters including an Ace; excellent for clearing a monster taken by Widow Anchor."},"76072561":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"On Special Summon, search a Striker Spell. Zero can search or use the Tribute deployment effect that turn\u2014not both."},"76666602":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 LIGHT or DARK monster + 1 Effect Monster\r\nWhile an \"Ecclesia\" monster is on the field or in either GY, this card gains 500 ATK, also it is unaffected by other cards' effects. You can only use each of the following effects of \"The Dragon that Devours the Dogma\" once per turn. If this card is Special Summoned: You can shuffle up to 2 cards from any GY(s) and/or banishment into the Deck. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add 1 \"Dogmatika\" or \"Tri-Brigade\" card from your Deck to your hand."},"78114463":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Can be activated the turn it was Set by revealing another Set Trap; choose the LP mode deliberately."},"78199891":{"role":"Trap","quick":"While you control a Mikanko, target a face-up monster and equip an Equip Spell from Deck that can legally equip to it.","caution":"You need a Mikanko already on field. Rondo can equip to an opponent\u2019s monster and immediately take it."},"79912449":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Equip an opposing monster, then control it while you control a Mikanko. It remains equipped under your control.","caution":"Both players are prevented from activating that monster\u2019s effects while you control it. Losing Rondo sends the equipped monster to GY."},"80044027":{"role":"Equip Spell","quick":"Summons a Mikanko from hand or GY and equips it. Can optionally put a negated monster from their GY back on their field as a damage target.","caution":"Only one activation per turn. The optional opposing revival requires a legal GY target. Equipping it through Ohime is not the same as activating its summon effect."},"80843006":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"1 Spellcaster monster + 1 non-Spellcaster monster\r\nYou can target 1 face-up monster on the field and declare 1 Attribute; it becomes that Attribute. During your opponent's Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, by banishing this card you control and monsters from your field or GY as material. If this card is in your GY: You can declare 1 Attribute; this card in the GY becomes that Attribute until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of \"Mixousia the Confounder\" once per turn."},"81196066":{"role":"2 Lunalights. If Fusion Summoned, searches Luna Light Perfume; can target another Lunalight card you control to return it to hand/Extra Deck, then optionally Special Summon a Lunalight from hand. Its GY banish reduces opposing ATK by original DEF.","quick":"21442"},"81260679":{"role":"LIGHT \u00b7 Level 6 \u00b7 ATK 0","quick":"Reveals herself to search a Mikanko card, then discards. Preparation finds her. Ceremony can bring her onto the field, where she can equip a suitable GY Equip Spell as a Quick Effect.","caution":"The discard happens during resolution, not as activation cost. She is Level 6, not a Rank 3 material. Ceremony does not properly Ritual Summon her."},"81439173":{"role":"GY access","quick":"Send one monster from Deck to GY. Limited to one."},"82344137":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"You can reveal this card and 1 Spell/Trap in your hand; until the end of the next turn, neither player can activate cards or effects in response to the activation of cards, or effects of cards, with the revealed Spell/Trap's name. If this card is sent from the hand or field to the GY by a Spell/Trap effect: You can Special Summon this card. If this card is Special Summoned from the GY: You can take control of 1 monster your opponent controls with the highest ATK (your choice, if tied). You can only use each effect of \"Phara the Primordial Goddess\" once per turn."},"82489470":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When a monster declares an attack: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, negate that attack, then, if you control a Fusion Monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material, you can destroy the monster that declared that attack. If a monster is banished face-up (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card from your field or GY; Special Summon 1 LIGHT Spellcaster monster from your hand or GY whose ATK equals its own DEF. You can only use this effect of \"The Golden Swordsoul\" once per turn."},"83190280":{"role":"Pendulum revival","quick":"Pendulum effect revives a Lunalight from GY with its effects negated; it cannot attack and is destroyed during the End Phase."},"84550369":{"role":"Normal Spell","quick":"Sets up the GY and a Mikanko Spell/Trap. The doctrine\u2019s first line sends Sanaki and sets Fire Dance.","caution":"Only one of its two effects can be used per turn. You cannot use the GY Ritual-summon effect later in the same turn as its normal effect. The normal effect restricts later Extra Deck summons."},"86066372":{"role":"Conditional \u00b7 Link 4","quick":"Unicorn (3) + an extra Effect Monster (1) is legal when unlocked, and makes 5300 ATK through Unicorn. The previous list did not provide a reliable spare-body sequence for this ladder. Keep as an optional ladder payoff, never assume it is a routine finish.","caution":"At least two Effect Monsters totaling Link Rating 4. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"87209160":{"role":"GY access","quick":"Send itself from hand or field to GY to send a Level 3 or lower Beast, Beast-Warrior, or Winged Beast from Deck: Silver Hound is a key target."},"87746184":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 LIGHT monster\r\nIf this card is Fusion Summoned: You can Fusion Summon 1 Level 8 or lower Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, except \"Albion the Branded Dragon\", by banishing Fusion Materials mentioned on it from your hand, field, and/or GY. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add to your hand or Set 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap directly from your Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Albion the Branded Dragon\" once per turn."},"87931906":{"role":"Fusion","quick":"Fuse a Lunalight from hand/field. If your opponent controls a monster Special Summoned from the Extra Deck, you may also use one Lunalight from your Deck or Extra Deck."},"88753594":{"role":"3 Lunalights; once in GY, a later turn\u2019s effect can boost a Fusion you control by 3000 ATK.","quick":"14185"},"90448279":{"role":"LIGHT \u00b7 Rank 12 \u00b7 ATK 3000","quick":"A field reset after an Xyz has battled. Overlay Downerd and retain its stacked materials.","caution":"Its effect sends your other cards too. You cannot use the ordinary Mikanko combo and simply add Zeus after battle under its Extra Deck restriction."},"90590303":{"role":"Rank 4 fallback. In Defense Position it changes face-up monsters to Defense and negates their activated effects when activated there, including yours.","quick":"13163"},"90673288":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"If Special Summoned that turn, searches in the End Phase for a Striker Spell whose name is absent from your GY. Resolve Multirole first when Setting Engage will free that name."},"93039339":{"role":"DARK \u00b7 Rank 12 \u00b7 ATK 2900","quick":"A one-body emergency Xyz when the opponent\u2019s recent Extra Deck activity meets its condition.","caution":"The alternate summon ends your further Normal/Special Summons for the turn. Use your highest-ATK monster, not any arbitrarily chosen smaller monster."},"94145021":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"After a Deck-to-hand add, prevents further Deck-to-hand additions that turn."},"95515789":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If you control \"Fallen of Albaz\" or it is in your GY: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Fusion Summon 1 Level 8 or higher Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as material. During the End Phase, if a Fusion Monster(s) was sent to your GY this turn: You can add this card from the GY to your hand. You can only use each effect of \"Blazing Cartesia, the Virtuous\" once per turn."},"96381979":{"role":"Rank 4 that sets a Fire Formation from Deck; useful Tenki access after the Hound lock ends.","quick":"10407"},"96729612":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Finds Level 6 Ohime from Deck. The Ritual Spell recovery is optional and usually unused in this profile.","caution":"Preparation is not Pre-Preparation of Rites; they search differently."},"97165977":{"role":"Cat Dancer + a Lunalight; required name for Leo Dancer unless Chick supplies it.","quick":"12319"},"97268402":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"During your opponent's Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; negate the effects of that face-up monster your opponent controls, until the end of this turn."},"98127546":{"role":"Conditional \u00b7 Link 5","quick":"Example: your I:P (2) + Hu-Li (1) + Ha-Re (1) + an opposing Effect Monster (1). That is four actual bodies, totaling five. Three small Mikanko plus one ordinary opposing Effect Monster total only four, so are insufficient. Legal in special resource states, inefficient here.","caution":"At least four Effect Monsters totaling Link Rating 5; may use one opposing monster. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"98338152":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Negates a face-up monster; at 3 Spells it can take control and occupy your Main Monster Zone."},"98462037":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Needs two LIGHT and/or DARK monsters and converts material into targeted pressure."},"99550630":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Destroys a face-up monster; at 3 Spells it may also destroy a Spell/Trap."}}}
