 Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add 1 \"Polymerization\" Normal Spell or \"Fusion\" Normal Spell from your Deck to your hand."},"6327734":{"role":"WIND · Level 3 · ATK 0","quick":"Your protection piece. With any Equip Card under your control, your opponent cannot target your Mikanko cards. Becoming equipped searches a Mikanko Trap.","caution":"Her damage reflection and battle survival need an Equip Card on her specifically. Targeting protection is not immunity to all effects."},"6498706":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Reveal 1 Fusion Monster in your Extra Deck and Special Summon, from your hand or Deck, 1 of the Fusion Materials whose name is specifically listed on that card, also you cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck, except Fusion Monsters, the turn you activate this card. You can only activate 1 \"Fusion Deployment\" per turn."},"8264361":{"role":"Conditional · Link 2","quick":"No Main Deck monster here is DARK. An opponent’s DARK stolen with Rondo, Talent or sided Ni-Ni can supply it, but you must actually control that monster and avoid the Mikanko restriction. A DARK only in their GY cannot satisfy the summon. A DARK Xyz/Link fallback can also become material later, but that is a detour. A conditional toolbox slot; lower purchase priority.","caution":"Two monsters including DARK. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"8267140":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Pays 1000 LP to banish a Spell/Trap instead of sending it to a useful GY."},"8379983":{"role":"Starter","quick":"Search a different Lunalight monster when summoned, then discard a card. While it stays in the Monster Zone, a Lunalight sent to your GY can be returned to your hand."},"8491308":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Attacks directly and sends a Sky Striker card from Deck to GY after damage."},"9726840":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Sends another controlled card during resolution, deploys an Ace, then locks Extra Deck summons to