turn of resources."},"12580477":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Simple full opposing monster clear."},"13935001":{"role":"GY extender","quick":"In your Main Phase, banish it from GY as cost; on resolution, send a card from hand to GY, then summon a Lunalight from Deck if you sent a card. Its face-up trap effect can give the opponent a token after a Fusion Summon."},"14152693":{"role":"Cycle","quick":"On Normal or Special Summon, send a Lunalight card from hand to GY to draw one; its own send-by-effect trigger can revive a small Lunalight with effects negated."},"14532163":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Clears opposing backrow or Attack Position monsters while you control no face-up cards.","caution":"Use it before establishing face-up Mikanko or Equip Spells."},"14558127":{"role":"Hand trap","quick":"Discards itself to negate an effect that adds from Deck, summons from Deck, or sends from Deck."},"15693423":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Best from an empty field at the end of the Battle Phase."},"16259549":{"role":"LIGHT · Rank 3 · ATK 400","quick":"An unlocked Rank 3 that can survive battle by detaching. Its battle opens the Zeus route.","caution":"It does not reflect battle damage. Have enough LP to survive and a material to prevent destruction; two different players being unable to target it does not make it invulnerable."},"17217034":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Negates a 2500+ ATK monster on summon and can clear monsters after attacking when Raye and Roze are in GY."},"17751597":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated that includes an effect that Special Summons a monster(s): Return to the Extra Deck, 1 face-up Fusion Monster you control, or 2 Fusion Monsters in your GY, that mention \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material, and if you do, negate the activation, and if you do that, destroy that card. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap in your GY, except \"Branded Retribution\"; add it 